The active app/vlite-engine build is an independent behavior reconstruction.
Legacy BlackBox source remains in the repository history/worktree with its
original Apache-2.0 notices, but is excluded from this branch's Gradle modules
and must not appear in the generated host DEX/native libraries.

APK signature verification uses Android apksig 8.7.3 from the Android Open Source
Project, Apache License 2.0: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/tools/apksig/

Hidden Android API access uses AndroidHiddenApiBypass 6.1, Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/LSPosed/AndroidHiddenApiBypass
This standalone library does not require the Xposed/LSPosed runtime framework.

GBox/VLite artifacts are analyst-supplied research inputs only; they are not
included in this build or granted a new source license by this project.

